  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a.i\"><p><strong>a.i</strong></p><p>about 11 o’clock position on turntable ✔ In the region shown</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a.ii\"><p><strong>a.ii</strong></p><p>maximum frequency shift occurs when velocity of source relative to frequency meter is maximum ✔<br/>&lt;&lt;maximum velocity of source is&gt;&gt;when S moves directly towards frequency meter ✔</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>ALTERNATIVE 1<br/><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>10.5 «Hz» ✔ Range 10 – 11 Hz <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{10.5}{440}=\\frac{v_{s}}{330}\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{s}\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span> 7.9 &lt;&lt;m s<sup>−1</sup>&gt;&gt;<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{s}\"></span>=<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span> 7.9 «ms<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\"></span><sup>1</sup>» ✔ Range 7.5 – 8.3 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\"></span><sup>1</sup> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>«<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{r}\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>»28 ✔ Range 27 – 30 rad  s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\"></span><sup>1</sup> rad s<sup>−1</sup> ✔   ALTERNATIVE 2 Observed frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span> 450.5 OR 430 &lt;&lt;Hz&gt;&gt; ✔ Range 450 – 451 OR 429 – 431 Use of f' <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span> f (v/v<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"±\"></span>u<sub>s</sub>) ✔ u<sub>s</sub> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span> 7.7 &lt;&lt;m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\"></span><sup>1</sup>&gt;&gt; ✔ Range 7.5 – 8.0 omega &lt;&lt;<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span> v/r&gt;&gt; <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span> 28 ✔ Range 27 – 30 rad s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\"></span><sup>1</sup> ✔</p></section>"
